---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const jsonLd = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "WebPage",
  "name": "Numérologie Cabalistique — Calcule ton chemin de vie",
  "url": "https://plateforme-des-mysteres.com/numerologie/cabalistique/",
  "description": "Calcule ton chemin de vie et ton ticún selon la méthode Raúl Durán. 22 archétypes, interprétation personnalisée.",
  "inLanguage": "fr",
  "about": {
    "@type": "Thing",
    "name": "Numérologie Cabalistique"
  }
};
---

<Layout
  title="Numérologie Cabalistique — Calcule ton chemin de vie"
  description="Calcule ton chemin de vie et ton ticún selon la méthode Raúl Durán. 22 archétypes, interprétation personnalisée. Gratuit, sans inscription."
  keywords="numérologie, cabalistique, calcul numérologie, chemin de vie, ticún, Raúl Durán, archétypes, kabbale, gratuit"
  canonicalPath="numerologie/cabalistique/"
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
  scripts={["/assets/js/calculateur.js"]}
  breadcrumb={[
    { name: "Accueil", item: "https://plateforme-des-mysteres.com/" },
    { name: "Numérologie", item: "https://plateforme-des-mysteres.com/numerologie/" },
    { name: "Cabalistique", item: "https://plateforme-des-mysteres.com/numerologie/cabalistique/" }
  ]}
  section="numerologie"
>

<!-- ═══════════ FIL D'ARIANE ═══════════ -->
<nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Fil d'Ariane" style="padding:0.8rem 1.5rem;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--text-muted);max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;">
  <a href="/" style="color:var(--cyan);">Accueil</a> &rsaquo;
  <a href="/numerologie/" style="color:var(--cyan);">Numérologie</a> &rsaquo;
  <span style="color:var(--text);">Cabalistique</span>
</nav>

<!-- ═══════════ HERO / BANNIÈRE ═══════════ -->
<section id="hero">
  <h1>
    <span class="pulse"></span>
    Les nombres sont le <span class="gold">langage</span><br>de la <span class="emerald">conscience</span>
  </h1>
  <p class="subtitle">
    Découvre ce que ta date de naissance révèle sur ton chemin de vie, tes dons, et les défis que ton âme est venue rectifier — selon la sagesse cabalistique de Raúl Durán.
  </p>
  <a href="#calculateur" class="cta">✦ Révéler mes nombres</a>
  <p class="quote">
    « Dieu est là où sont tes problèmes. La plupart fuient leurs problèmes — alors que les problèmes sont le laboratoire que la vie t'offre pour exercer tes dons. »
    <br><span class="gold">— Talmud</span>
  </p>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════ CALCULATEUR ═══════════ -->
<section id="calculateur">
  <div class="section-title">
    <div class="num">[ 01 ]</div>
    <h2>✦ Calculateur Numérologique</h2>
    <p class="slate">Entre ta date de naissance et découvre ton chemin de vie et ton ticún.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="max-width:600px;margin:0 auto 1.5rem;text-align:center;">
    <p class="cab-intro-text">
      <strong class="cab-label-emerald">Chemin de vie</strong> = ton don, ta mission d'âme.
      <strong class="cab-label-gold">Ticún</strong> = le défi que tu es venu·e rectifier.
    </p>
    <p class="cab-intro-sub">
      Entre ta date de naissance et découvre tes deux nombres sacrés.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="calc-form">
    <input type="text" id="dateInput" inputmode="numeric" pattern="\d{2}/\d{2}/\d{4}" placeholder="JJ/MM/AAAA" maxlength="10" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Date de naissance au format JJ/MM/AAAA">
    <button type="button" onclick="document.getElementById('dateInput').value='23/10/1990';reveal()" style="background:transparent;border:1px solid #334155;color:#94a3b8;padding:0.9rem 1.2rem;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.85rem;">Essayer avec un exemple</button>
    <button id="calcBtn" onclick="reveal()" aria-label="Calculer ma numérologie">Révéler mes nombres ✦</button>
  </div>
  <div class="error-msg" id="errorMsg"></div>

  <div id="resultat">
    <div class="calc-detail reveal-section" id="calcDetail"></div>
    <div class="result-cards reveal-section" id="resultCards"></div>
    <div class="result-interpretation reveal-section" id="resultInterpretation"></div>
    <div class="repartition-section reveal-section" id="repartitionSection"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════ ARCHÉTYPES ═══════════ -->
<section id="archetypes">
  <div class="section-title">
    <div class="num">[ 02 ]</div>
    <h2>✦ Les 22 Archétypes</h2>
    <p class="slate">Chaque nombre (1-22) est à la fois un don et un défi. Clique pour découvrir l'ombre.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="grid" id="archetypesGrid"></div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════ MÉTHODE ═══════════ -->
<section id="methode">
  <div class="section-title">
    <div class="num">[ 03 ]</div>
    <h2>✦ La Méthode</h2>
    <p class="slate">Comment fonctionne le calcul, selon Raúl Durán.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="steps">
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-num">1</div>
      <h3>Réduire</h3>
      <p>Chaque composant de ta date (jour, mois, année) est réduit à un nombre ≤ 22 en sommant ses chiffres.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-num">2</div>
      <h3>Chemin de vie</h3>
      <p>La somme des trois nombres réduits donne ton chemin de vie — ton don, ta « personalidad profunda ».</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-num">3</div>
      <h3>Ticún</h3>
      <p>La soustraction ordonnée des trois nombres (max − mid − min) révèle ton ticún — le défi que ton âme est venue rectifier.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-num">4</div>
      <h3>Interpréter</h3>
      <p>Chaque nombre correspond à un archétype avec une force (don) et une faiblesse (ticún). La clé est d'utiliser le don pour traverser le défi.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

  <p slot="sources" style="color:#64748b;font-size:0.75rem;margin-bottom:0.8rem;">
    Sources : <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eVfgONpEoDo" target="_blank">Podcast Lo Grande — Raúl Durán</a>
  </p>

</Layout>

<style is:global>
  /* ═══════════ CALCULATEUR RÉSULTATS — styles globaux (éléments injectés via JS) ═══════════ */

  /* Neutralise le fond doré italique hérité */
  .result-interpretation {
    background: transparent !important;
    border: none !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    font-style: normal !important;
  }

  /* Layout des deux cartes principales */
  #resultCards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  /* ─── Intro sous le titre ─── */
  .cab-intro-text {
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .cab-intro-sub {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  .cab-label-emerald { color: var(--emerald); }
  .cab-label-gold    { color: var(--gold); }

  /* ─── Formule de calcul ─── */
  .calc-detail {
    background: linear-gradient(150deg, rgba(18,25,42,0.85) 0%, rgba(10,13,23,0.92) 100%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1.25rem 1.75rem;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }
  .calc-formula { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.65rem; }
  .cf-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .cf-item { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
  .cf-lbl {
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-bottom: 0.15rem;
  }
  .cf-num {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--slate);
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .cf-sep, .cf-eq, .cf-arrow {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.05rem;
  }
  .cf-total {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--slate);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 0.15rem 0.45rem;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .cf-result {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  }
  .cf-result strong { font-size: 1.2rem; }

  /* Utilitaires couleur */
  .cf-cyan   { color: var(--cyan) !important; }
  .cf-violet { color: var(--violet) !important; }
  .cf-emerald { color: var(--emerald) !important; }
  .cf-gold   { color: var(--gold) !important; }

  /* ─── Lecture croisée ─── */
  .lc-section { margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
  .lc-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
  }
  .lc-sym { color: var(--gold); font-size: 0.95rem; }
  .lc-title {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    flex: 1;
  }
  .lc-badge {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--gold);
    background: rgba(223,178,108,0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(223,178,108,0.25);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.65rem;
  }
  .lc-cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .lc-card {
    background: linear-gradient(150deg, rgba(18,25,42,0.92) 0%, rgba(10,13,23,0.97) 100%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
    transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1), box-shadow 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }
  .lc-chemin { border-top: 2px solid var(--emerald); }
  .lc-ticun  { border-top: 2px solid var(--gold); }
  .lc-card:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .lc-chemin:hover { box-shadow: 0 12px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.45), 0 0 25px -8px var(--emerald); }
  .lc-ticun:hover  { box-shadow: 0 12px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.45), 0 0 25px -8px var(--gold); }
  .lc-num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .lc-role {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .lc-force {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
  }
  .lc-interp {
    font-size: 0.87rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  /* ─── Composantes numériques ─── */
  .composantes-section {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
  }
  .composantes-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .comp-sym { color: var(--violet); font-size: 1rem; }
  .comp-title {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-weight: 400;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Mini-cartes Jour / Mois / Année */
  .raw-numbers {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .raw-card {
    background: linear-gradient(150deg, rgba(18,25,42,0.90) 0%, rgba(10,13,23,0.96) 100%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 1.25rem 1rem;
    text-align: center;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.30);
    transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1), box-shadow 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.2rem;
  }
  .raw-card:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); }
  .raw-jour  { border-top: 2px solid var(--cyan); }
  .raw-mois  { border-top: 2px solid var(--violet); }
  .raw-annee { border-top: 2px solid var(--emerald); }
  .raw-jour:hover  { box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(0,0,0,0.40), 0 0 20px -8px var(--cyan); }
  .raw-mois:hover  { box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(0,0,0,0.40), 0 0 20px -8px var(--violet); }
  .raw-annee:hover { box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(0,0,0,0.40), 0 0 20px -8px var(--emerald); }
  .raw-num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.1;
    display: block;
  }
  .raw-jour  .raw-num { color: var(--cyan); }
  .raw-mois  .raw-num { color: var(--violet); }
  .raw-annee .raw-num { color: var(--emerald); }
  .raw-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    display: block;
  }
  .raw-desc {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Cartes d'interprétation Jour/Mois/Année */
  .detail-interpretations {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  .interp-card {
    background: linear-gradient(150deg, rgba(18,25,42,0.88) 0%, rgba(10,13,23,0.94) 100%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    border-left: 3px solid transparent;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1), box-shadow 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1);
  }
  .interp-jour  { border-left-color: var(--cyan); }
  .interp-mois  { border-left-color: var(--violet); }
  .interp-annee { border-left-color: var(--emerald); }
  .interp-card:hover {
    transform: translateX(4px);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.30);
  }
  .interp-card h4 {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .interp-jour  h4 { color: var(--cyan); }
  .interp-mois  h4 { color: var(--violet); }
  .interp-annee h4 { color: var(--emerald); }
  .interp-card p {
    font-size: 0.87rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ─── Portrait d'Âme ─── */
  .portrait {
    background: linear-gradient(150deg, rgba(18,25,42,0.90) 0%, rgba(10,13,23,0.96) 100%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(223,178,108,0.16);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--gold);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1.75rem 2rem;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  .portrait-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(223,178,108,0.12);
  }
  .portrait-sym { font-size: 1.1rem; }
  .portrait-title {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--gold);
    font-weight: 400;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .portrait-text {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-style: italic;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ─── Responsive ─── */
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    #resultCards   { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .lc-cards      { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .raw-numbers   { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
    .cf-row        { gap: 0.35rem; }
    .cf-result     { font-size: 0.82rem; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 420px) {
    .raw-numbers   { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  /* ─── Light mode overrides ─── */
  [data-theme="light"] .lc-header,
  [data-theme="light"] .composantes-section,
  [data-theme="light"] .portrait-header {
    border-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
  }
  [data-theme="light"] .lc-card,
  [data-theme="light"] .raw-card,
  [data-theme="light"] .interp-card,
  [data-theme="light"] .portrait {
    background: #ffffff;
    border-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
  }
  [data-theme="light"] .lc-card:hover,
  [data-theme="light"] .raw-card:hover,
  [data-theme="light"] .interp-card:hover {
    box-shadow: 0 12px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
  }
  [data-theme="light"] .lc-title,
  [data-theme="light"] .comp-title,
  [data-theme="light"] .lc-role,
  [data-theme="light"] .raw-label {
    color: #475569;
  }
  [data-theme="light"] .lc-interp,
  [data-theme="light"] .raw-desc,
  [data-theme="light"] .interp-card p,
  [data-theme="light"] .portrait-text {
    color: #334155;
  }
  [data-theme="light"] .portrait {
    border-color: rgba(180,133,59,0.25);
    border-left-color: var(--gold);
  }

  [data-theme="light"] .cab-intro-text { color: #334155; }
  [data-theme="light"] .cab-intro-sub  { color: #475569; }
  [data-theme="light"] .cab-label-emerald { color: #047857; }
  [data-theme="light"] .cab-label-gold    { color: #92400e; }

  [data-theme="light"] .calc-detail {
    background: #ffffff;
    border-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
  }
  [data-theme="light"] .cf-lbl,
  [data-theme="light"] .cf-sep,
  [data-theme="light"] .cf-eq,
  [data-theme="light"] .cf-arrow {
    color: #475569;
  }
  [data-theme="light"] .cf-num,
  [data-theme="light"] .cf-total {
    color: #0f172a;
  }
  [data-theme="light"] .cf-total {
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
    border-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
  }
</style>
